<resources>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserker">Berserker</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserkerIntroBlurb">Kill to shorten your cooldown and become War.</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserkerTabDescription">Kill players to reduce your cooldown. Collect enough kills to become &lt;color=#EEEEEE&gt;War&lt;/color&gt;.</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserkerWikiDescription">The &lt;color=#B81020&gt;Berserker&lt;/color&gt; is a &lt;b&gt;Neutral Apocalypse&lt;/b&gt; role. Each kill lowers your kill cooldown until you collect enough kills to become &lt;color=#EEEEEE&gt;War&lt;/color&gt;. If Apocalypse Wins Together is enabled, Apocalypse roles are treated as allies.</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserkerKillsTab">Kills to become War</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleBerserkerWarAnnouncement">War has consumed the battlefield.\%nl\%\%color=#EEEEEEFF\%War\%/color\%, Horseman of the Apocalypse, has emerged!</string>

  <string name="ExtensionRoleWar">War</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleWarIntroBlurb">Tear through the battlefield.</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleWarTabDescription">Kill rapidly during your spree window. War is invincible and can only die by exile.</string>
  <string name="ExtensionRoleWarWikiDescription">The &lt;color=#EEEEEE&gt;War&lt;/color&gt; is the transformed Berserker. War is immune to attacks and hostile abilities, can chain kills during a short spree window, and can only be killed by being voted out.</string>

